respect your time and intelligence. Now includes the Backside Story expansion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.poster.avif?t=1785174853\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.webm?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/extras/5d9b3b68ca02e656af0d88a5a81ae300.mp4?t=1785174853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARMING-AS-HECK WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for VR, comfortable for everyone, and developed with love by the small but mighty Turbo Button team.</p>", "short_description": "Explore a tower of hilarious escape rooms and solve mind-bending puzzles in this absurd elevator adventure for virtual reality. Step out onto each floor, meet bizarre characters, unravel their secrets, and figure out how everything is connected to find the lost artifacts your boss is looking for.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“Floor Plan 2 feels like a VR episode of The Muppet Show, not just in the hilarious absurdity of its world but also in the constant, invigorating ingenuity of its puzzles.”<br>4/5 – Upload VR<br><br>“This is one of the best puzzle games in VR.”<br>A Wolf in VR<br><br>“I absolutely adore this game.”<br>4.8/5 – The Escape Roomer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/7949eb5abfa5fd88c5168d64af7ebf676ba37112/header.jpg?t=1785174853", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534850/eecc285417a22195ca5836c1727bad3bc182d3a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178